Now that the public DNS record is configured, here is the exact roadmap to get Centreon Map live and working:

---

### Step 1: Clarify the Exact DNS Hostname

Please confirm which DNS entry you created:
* **Option A**: Did you update `extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr` to point to `109.62.62.18`?
* **Option B**: Did you create a new subdomain (e.g. `map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr` $\rightarrow$ `109.62.62.18`)?
  > [!NOTE]
  > If you used a new subdomain, we must add it to `server_name` in Nginx (and ensure the SSL certificate covers it). If you kept `extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr`, no certificate change is needed.

---

### Step 2: Fix the Nginx Virtual Host on `th2-revproxyp-fe1` (`172.30.198.33`)

On the reverse proxy, the port 9443 block in [`/etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf`](file:///etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf) currently points to `http://172.30.198.50` (port 80 plain HTTP), which triggers an immediate <span style="color:red">**502 Bad Gateway**</span>.

We need to update it with:
1. **Target Protocol & Port**: `https://172.30.198.50:9443` with `proxy_ssl_verify off;`.
2. **Port Preservation**: Uncomment `proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Port 9443;` and pass `$http_host` so Tomcat redirects don't drop the `:9443` port.
3. **Context Redirection**: Redirect `/` to `/centreon-map/` so users don't land on Tomcat's default 404 page.

#### Updated Server Block:
```nginx
# HTTPS redirect MAP
server {
    listen              172.30.198.33:9443 ssl http2 reuseport;
    server_name         extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr;

    # SSL
    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/fullchain.pem;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/privkey.pem;

    # security
    include             nginxconfig.io/security.conf;

    # logging
    access_log          /var/log/nginx/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-9443-access.log;
    error_log           /var/log/nginx/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-9443-error.log warn;

    # Explicit root redirection to Centreon Map web app
    location = / {
        return 301 /centreon-map/;
    }

    # Reverse proxy to Centreon Map (Tomcat HTTPS on 9443)
    location / {
        proxy_pass                 https://172.30.198.50:9443;
        proxy_ssl_verify           off;

        include                    nginxconfig.io/proxy.conf;
