1. **Separation of Concerns (Modularity)**:
   * [`02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf`](file:///etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf) handles strictly **Centreon Web** (`:443`) and LoRaWAN (`:8443`).
